    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persevere is a turn-based survival RPG set on a grim island on which you will manage a small team of exiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control over exiles and manage their physical and mental well-being. Craft, buy, or find equipment by exploring to help you survive until the light of a new day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/5d690802359d574e1f2da7e1e27bcb28.poster.avif?t=1753972459\" width=800 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/5d690802359d574e1f2da7e1e27bcb28.webm?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/5d690802359d574e1f2da7e1e27bcb28.mp4?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of the unique mechanics of the new health and psyche system based on grid. Discover different weapons with their unique attacks. Choose from four different attack types: firearm, melee, throwable and placeable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/d6ad8d67134542f0d3fd66f6bd7bef1f.poster.avif?t=1753972459\" width=734 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/d6ad8d67134542f0d3fd66f6bd7bef1f.webm?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/d6ad8d67134542f0d3fd66f6bd7bef1f.mp4?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on quests, trade with wandering merchants, master new skills and listen to your characters stories, thoughts and fears - and at day's end, set up camp to rest and prepare for tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/28107516a863f47197d3d9dcbcea06cb.poster.avif?t=1753972459\" width=698 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/28107516a863f47197d3d9dcbcea06cb.webm?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/28107516a863f47197d3d9dcbcea06cb.mp4?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique turn-based combat system built upon grids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight against bosses and different kinds of Affects - physical manifestations of emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience a captivating story and encounter NPCs in side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >build a team from the selection of 9 different characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore an open world island with places to uncover ancient secrets and find treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find and use a great variety of different items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discover each character's personality and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect ingredients and craft various items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >listen to your characters' stories through a huge amount of lines of dialogues and monologues</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persevere is a turn-based survival RPG set on a grim island on which you will manage a small team of exiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control over exiles and manage their physical and mental well-being. Craft, buy, or find equipment by exploring to help you survive until the light of a new day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/5d690802359d574e1f2da7e1e27bcb28.poster.avif?t=1753972459\" width=800 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/5d690802359d574e1f2da7e1e27bcb28.webm?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/5d690802359d574e1f2da7e1e27bcb28.mp4?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of the unique mechanics of the new health and psyche system based on grid. Discover different weapons with their unique attacks. Choose from four different attack types: firearm, melee, throwable and placeable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/d6ad8d67134542f0d3fd66f6bd7bef1f.poster.avif?t=1753972459\" width=734 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/d6ad8d67134542f0d3fd66f6bd7bef1f.webm?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/d6ad8d67134542f0d3fd66f6bd7bef1f.mp4?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on quests, trade with wandering merchants, master new skills and listen to your characters stories, thoughts and fears - and at day's end, set up camp to rest and prepare for tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/28107516a863f47197d3d9dcbcea06cb.poster.avif?t=1753972459\" width=698 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/28107516a863f47197d3d9dcbcea06cb.webm?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/28107516a863f47197d3d9dcbcea06cb.mp4?t=1753972459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique turn-based combat system built upon grids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight against bosses and different kinds of Affects - physical manifestations of emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience a captivating story and encounter NPCs in side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >build a team from the selection of 9 different characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore an open world island with places to uncover ancient secrets and find treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find and use a great variety of different items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discover each character's personality and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect ingredients and craft various items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >listen to your characters' stories through a huge amount of lines of dialogues and monologues</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Persevere is a turn-based survival RPG set on a grim and mysterious island. Control your team, explore an open world and fight Affects in an innovative combat system. Will your characters survive or descend into madness?",
